[medium] internal/api/handler/oscal/dashboard_suggestion_diagnostics.go:364 (correctness)
The diagnostics summary and run list read token/cache/rate-limit totals from dashboard_suggestion_runs, but those run-level rollups are only populated in finalizeRunIfReady after every cell has left pending. During an active run, completed cells already have input/cache tokens and snoozed pending cells already have rate_limited_count, yet /admin/ai-diagnostics/summary and /runs report zero for those values and rate_limit_pressure can pass while the run is actively being throttled.
Suggested fix: Aggregate input_tokens, output_tokens, cache_*_input_tokens, and rate_limited_count from dashboard_suggestion_run_cells for diagnostics (extend the cell_progress subquery in loadRuns and the cell totals in loadTotals), or update run-level rollups whenever cells complete/snooze. Add a test with a running run that has one completed cell and one rate-limited pending cell.
Guidance: In internal/api/handler/oscal/dashboard_suggestion_diagnostics.go, make diagnostics read token/cache/rate-limit totals from dashboard_suggestion_run_cells for live runs instead of relying only on dashboard_suggestion_runs rollups, which are only finalized after all cells leave pending. In loadTotals, extend the existing cellTotals query to also SUM(input_tokens), SUM(output_tokens), SUM(cache_read_input_tokens), SUM(cache_creation_input_tokens), and SUM(rate_limited_count), then assign those sums to totals.InputTokens, totals.OutputTokens, totals.CacheReadInputTokens, totals.CacheCreationInputTokens, and totals.RateLimitedTotal. Keep run status counts from dashboard_suggestion_runs. In loadRuns, extend the cell_progress subquery with the same SUM columns and add matching fields to aiDiagnosticsRunRow. Pass those values into runResponse or set them on the embedded DashboardSuggestionRun before calling runResponse so each row's InputTokens, CacheHitRatio, and RateLimitedTotal reflect completed/snoozed cells during running runs. Do not update run-level rollups on every cell completion/snooze; that would duplicate finalization behavior and add write contention. Add/adjust an integration test in internal/api/handler/oscal/dashboard_suggestions_integration_test.go that seeds a running run with one completed cell containing token/cache values and one pending cell with rate_limited_count > 0 while the run row rollups are still zero, then asserts /admin/ai-diagnostics/summary and /admin/ai-diagnostics/runs expose the cell totals and the rate_limit_pressure check can see the snooze count.
